          "text": "{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If an earlier Bangkok arrival and a shorter trip matter to you, the Aeroplan award departing at 11:30 p.m. on January 15 is a strong choice among these shown awards: it arrives 5 hours 20 minutes before the other late-departure option and takes 21 hours. The tradeoff is an economy itinerary with one stop and a 2-hour-45-minute connection at Taipei. The cash fare is a separate reference, not a like-for-like total-cost comparison.\"}]},{\"start\":2,\"end\":3,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award • earlier departure and arrival\",\"v\":\"One reported seat; 65,000 Aeroplan points plus a quoted CAD 116.50 in taxes and fees (quote scope unknown). Reported economy, one stop at Taipei, and a 4-hour-30-minute connection; leg cabins are unspecified. It departs SFO January 15 at noon and arrives BKK January 17 at 1:25 a.m., with 22 hours 25 minutes elapsed. Choose this instead if arriving earlier matters more than leaving later: it arrives 10 hours 5 minutes before the recommended award. In return, you leave SFO 11 hours 30 minutes earlier and spend 1 hour 25 minutes longer in transit. The point and fee figures alone do not establish the trip’s total cost.\"}]},{\"start\":3,\"end\":4,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award • BR and TG carriers\",\"v\":\"One reported seat; 65,000 Aeroplan points plus a quoted CAD 116.50 in taxes and fees (quote scope unknown). Reported economy, one stop at Taipei, and an 8-hour-15-minute connection; leg cabins are unspecified. It departs SFO January 15 at 11:30 p.m. and arrives BKK January 17 at 4:50 p.m., taking 26 hours 20 minutes. You might choose it if the BR/TG carrier combination listed for this itinerary suits you; compared with the recommended award, it arrives 5 hours 20 minutes later, has a connection 5 hours 30 minutes longer, and takes 5 hours 20 minutes longer overall. Carrier listings do not establish flight protection or other booking details.\"}]}]}",
